WEBVTT

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:05.200
The sun... They're sealing the sky.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.050
I brought light from the Maker's nib!

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.100
Without sun or flame,
stained glass has no voice.

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:53.250
Then borrow this flame
and shatter their silence!

00:01:53.950 --> 00:01:59.100
Every color on this desk is only
a rough draft waiting to be erased.
